        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every Shree Ashirwad container is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live coordinates to our customer portal. You receive real‑time updates, estimated arrival times, and a clickable map, so you always know the precise status of your car delivery.</p>
