        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Full‑coverage, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance is automatically included in every quote. It covers accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards up to the declared value of your vehicle, giving you peace of mind without any hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
