        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our transparent pricing model factors in the exact distance (≈850 km), vehicle dimensions, chosen container size, insurance coverage, and applicable GST. Once the quote is issued, the price remains locked regardless of traffic or fuel price fluctuations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
